  "notes": "Grunnskóli is one ten-year school (1.–10. bekkur, yngsta stig 1–4, miðstig 5–7, unglingastig 8–10), started in the calendar year a child turns 6. Framhaldsskóli is not compulsory; the three-year academic route to the stúdentspróf is shown. Vocational programmes vary in length, and many schools teach in courses (áfangakerfi) rather than year groups, so learners may count upper-secondary years differently."
